

                   ADVENTURER-KINGS:  GAME 3, TURN 4

                                  FOR

                   SHAMAN UGA-BUGA MAKUMBU







  Quote of the Week:

  John Wilkes, English radical politician, attacking the speech of King 
Charles in 1763:
  "In vain will such a man, or the foul dregs of his power, the tools of 
despotism and corruption, preach up 'the spirit of concord'.  They have sent 
the spirit of discord through the land."


ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:

  In spring, Amalric enlisted enough men in Mare Tarkium to create the 293rd 
Dragons for the army of Uga-Buga Makumb.
  Uga-Buga Makumb flew into the Icaria Sea.
  Windy spring blossomed into early summer.  Uga-Buga Makumb rode his flying 
armies over to the Near-Beer Sea.
  With the advent of the late summer season, Elmer was magically charmed by 
Uga-Buga Makumb.  Uga-Buga Makumb sank his fangs into Elmer and drained all 
his blood.  Elmer changed to Undead alignment!
  In fall, Uga-Buga Makumb rode his flying armies into the Third Sea.
  The fall cooled into early winter.  Presto was magically charmed by 
Uga-Buga Makumb.  Uga-Buga Makumb bit his fangs into Presto and drained his 
blood.  Presto changed to Undead alignment!

  Thus endeth the adventures of Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll for this 
year.


  Your Majesty, I have news to report of wanderers in our kingdom:  
  Isis (#89) arose one morning with a desire to see Kajaani, and so left the 
Falkland Sea to journey to that province.
  Raiden (#96) grew tired of the scenery in the Virgo Sea and departed for 
the Moonshine Sea.


  Here is the financial report for Uga-Buga Makumb's kingdom: this turn, the 
Kingdom collected 88 gold in revenue.  22 gold was expended to finance our 
leaders.  The 287th Garrison, the 288th Garrison, the 293rd Dragons, the 
296th Fleet, the 297th Axemen, the 298th Garrison, the 300th Garrison and 
the 302nd Garrison trained well and improved in quality.  47 gold was 
expended to maintain our armies.  Uga-Buga Makumb was left with 19 gold in 
the treasury.


LETTER REPORTS

  O King of Kings, thy heroes have travelled around the globe in
search of adventure and conquest.  I have faithfully kept their
correspondence, and now I present it to thee:


From: Guerin
To: Uga-Buga Makumb

  Honored Sovereign, 

  With the advent of the spring season, I set out to quench my thirst for 
adventure.  I cast a Bless spell.  The Dolphin Sea was magically blessed and 
prospered.  The Bless affected no armies in the Dolphin Sea.
  In early summer, I moved into the Ark Royal Sea (#1306) with my 
high-spirited army.  Turning to the northeast, one espies a Sea area, which 
is known as Oceanus Cyclopia (#1405).  It is populated by no races and 
no one rules there.  East of here is the Plesiosaurus Sea (#1406), a poor 
Forest province owned by Kurtinaitis, where Elves dwell.  Their Elven 
warriors array themselves in the style of Bowmen and Chariots.  To the 
southeast there is a Sea province known as the Stonegard Sea (#1407), a 
prosperous area of Mermen where no one rules.  If need be, they can call on 
a host of Mermen to defend their province.

  Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll ordered an invasion force into the 
Mountain province of the Ark Royal Sea, owned by Dracona (#38).  I was in 
command of the attacking armies.  The defending forces were commanded by 
Dracona.  The armies were drawn up into lines of battle as shown here:

  ATTACKING ARMY, Battle of the Ark Royal Sea (1306):

  241st   
  Bowmen  
