GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT


Kingdom of Babba Sissoko (#0):
  In early summer, a conquering horde owing their allegiance to 
Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) invaded the province of the Iceberg 
Sea, a Mountain area owned by Alain (#33).  Babba Sissoko (#0) commanded the 
attacking armies.  The defending forces were commanded by Alain (#33).  The 
Iceberg Sea was overrun by Babba Sissoko (#0)'s forces in a hard-fought 
campaign.

  In fall, an army sent by the empire of Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango 
entered the Albatross Sea, hoping to subjugate that province ruled by 
Kishijoten (#93) and made up of great Mountains.  Babba Sissoko (#0) was in 
command of the attacking armies.  The defenders were commanded by Kishijoten 
(#93).  The Albatross Sea was overrun by the forces of Babba Sissoko (#0).
  In late summer, Rainulf (#25) flew into the Iceberg Sea.
  In early winter, Rainulf rode his flying armies into the Albatross Sea.

  In spring, a great fleet of ships carried the banner of 
Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) into the Sea province of the Stonegard 
Sea, ruled by the provincial Merman chieftain.  Riose (#52) commanded the 
attacking fleet.  The defenders were led by the provincial Merman chieftain. 
Although Riose's host were triumphant, the provincial Merman chieftain 
regrouped its men and prepared to fight for the Stonegard Sea.

  In early summer, in the Stonegard Sea, Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango 
(#0) brought to bay the provincial Merman chieftain.  Riose (#52) commanded 
the attacking fleet.  The defending forces were led by the provincial Merman 
chieftain.  The Stonegard Sea was conquered by Riose's men in a hard-fought 
campaign.

